   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\">\n  <li>Sketch or describe the figure in Step 4 and Step 15.<br> <br> <img alt=\"Three steps of a growing pattern\" class=\"atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"130\" src=\"exercises/media/c267e3932bfff6f7.jpg\" width=\"386\"></li>\n</ol>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>How many small squares are in Step 4?</li>\n  </ol>",
